{"type":"text","timestamp":1784861956418,"sessionID":"ses_06df0c754ffeb07434xQiB9gkk","part":{"id":"prt_f920ff7f0001zODJY5OpwhiAHp","messageID":"msg_f920febd6001q61wrIPpbR1w2K","sessionID":"ses_06df0c754ffeb07434xQiB9gkk","type":"text","text":"The product descriptions of transactions at gas stations in the Czech Republic (Country = 'CZE') are:\n\n| # | Description |\n|---|-------------|\n| 1 | Nafta |\n| 2 | Provoz.nápl. |\n| 3 | Natural |\n| 4 | Nemrz.kapal. |\n| 5 | Oleje,tuky |\n| 6 | Diesel + |\n| 7 | LPG |\n| 8 | Mytí vozidel |\n| 9 | Autokosmet. |\n| 10 | Potraviny |\n| 11 | Nafta Plus |\n| 12 | Natural Spec |\n| 13 | Zpr.nakupu |\n| 14 | Autopřísluš. |\n| 15 | Natural + |\n| 16 | Dalnic.popl. |\n| 17 | Knihy,nov. |\n| 18 | Zboží nesp. |\n| 19 | Obcerstvení |\n| 20 | Additivum |\n| 21 | Natural Plus |\n\nThese 21 distinct product descriptions come from joining `transactions_1k` → `gasstations` (on GasStationID) → `products` (on ProductID), filtered by `gasstations.Country = 'CZE'`.\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer:** Nafta, Provoz.nápl., Natural, Nemrz.kapal., Oleje,tuky, Diesel +, LPG, Mytí vozidel, Autokosmet., Potraviny, Nafta Plus, Natural Spec, Zpr.nakupu, Autopřísluš., Natural +, Dalnic.popl., Knihy,nov., Zboží nesp., Obcerstvení, Additivum, Natural Plus\n\n**Evidence SQL:**\n```sql\nSELECT DISTINCT p.Description\nFROM transactions_1k t\nJOIN gasstations g ON t.GasStationID = g.GasStationID\nJOIN products p ON t.ProductID = p.ProductID\nWHERE g.Country = 'CZE'\n```","time":{"start":1784861947888,"end":1784861956413}}}
